From: MPVUI contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Native P7 opt-in; strict sample checks

Source: edde746/MPVKit b8b922ec74b84ac3a496e29e226a3a3e91491045
FFmpeg/0003-videotoolbox-convert-dolby-vision-p7.patch; RPU forwarding.
Authors: cxfksword / MPVKit contributors, Alex Kim, edde746.
Source copyright/license headers retained.

P7 conversion: default OFF; native devices only. libdovi mode 2 drops
enhancement layer and resets luma/chroma mapping. Require verified HDR10
base, parsed exact RPU, native session identity, matching converted-output
policy, and decoder RPU. Preserve P5/P8 checks, frame-thread session identity,
Metal pipeline, geometry/compositing guards, and Metal fallback.
No plain-HEVC base-only retry.

